# Windsurf Rules - Autonomous Engineering Pipeline

This project is governed by the engineering pipeline defined in `AGENTS.md`.

Autonomous Lifecycle:
1. Ground context using `graphify query` and clarify ambiguous requirements before writing code.
2. Define minimal contracts (`spec-driven-development`) and apply strict YAGNI (`ponytail`).
3. Break work down into atomic, testable tasks (`planning-and-task-breakdown`).
4. Write failing tests first, implement minimal code, and keep tests passing (`test-driven-development`).
5. Run multi-axis code review and security audits before completion (`code-review-and-quality`).
6. Sync the knowledge graph after code changes (`graphify update .`).
